Key notes about the extraction:
1. Entities were identified from core concepts like Case, Suspect, Property that have attributes and appear throughout the document
2. Actors were extracted from all user types mentioned (police, admin, citizens, etc.)
3. Functions were derived from module names and key actions described (register, investigate, search, etc.)
4. Aliases include all variations found in the document (English, Chinese, abbreviations)
5. Related terms were consolidated under single entries (e.g., PoliceOfficer includes all police-related terms)
6. The structure follows the requested format with IDs in SNAKE_CASE and names in PascalCase

The registry covers all major concepts from the requirements while avoiding duplication of equivalent terms.

